commit 5f59d677b3f222014c200bb65df5ee75eeb8b5dd

C03: the reassurance acknowledgement may have two short sentences (CONVERSATION1349)

CONVERSATION1347 measured: the reassurance shape produced «Gracias, entiendo. No hay problema.», its contract demanded a single sentence and rejected it, and the structured retry came back empty (truncated_structured_reply), so the turn fell to a recovery clarification. The contract now accepts up to two short sentences; the other rules (no question, no claim about the PC or an action done) stay.

No .NET change. Offline probe only; tests not run (owner order).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


